====== TP-Link TL-WR840N(EU) v4 ======

The device is a wireless N router with 
  * 2 fixed antennas
  * 4 Port 100/10 Switch
  * 1 Port 100/10 Wan Interface
  * 8 MB Flash
  * 64 MB Ram
  * WPS Button

**''Note1:''** The [[.:tl-wr841n|TL-WR841N]](D) as well as TL-WR840N(D) v1 and v2 is very different in being Broadcom- and Atheros based respectively, instead of Mediatek. Might be similar to TL-WR841N v13\\

